    <briefdescription>
<para>Option to add extra bits to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1ilist__iterator" kindref="compound">ilist_iterator</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Some use-cases (debug-info) need to know whether a position is intended to be half-open or fully open, i.e. whether to include any immediately adjacent debug-info in an operation. This option adds two bits to the iterator class to store that information. </para>
